      "text": "he shall save his people from their sins, Matt. 1:21. to fulfil all righteousness, Matt. 3:15. to save that which was lost, Matt. 18:11. I may preach there also: for therefore came I, Mark 1:38. shall reign over the house of Jacob, Luke 1:33. sent me to heal the brokenhearted, to preach, Luke 4:18. All things were made by him, John 1:3 (1:14; Col. 1:16–18). not to do mine own will, but the will of him that sent me, John 6:38 (3 Ne. 27:13). Son of man should be glorified, John 12:23 (3 Ne. 11:11). glorify thy Son, that thy Son also may glorify thee, John 17:1. in Christ shall all be made alive, 1 Cor. 15:22. author of eternal salvation, Heb. 5:9 (Mosiah 3:9). mediator of the new testament, Heb. 9:15.",
