      "text": "make intercession for all, 2 Ne. 2:9. suffereth himself to … die for all men, 2 Ne. 9:5. reconciled unto him through the atonement of Christ, Jacob 4:11. salvation … through faith on his name, Mosiah 3:9. publisheth peace; that bringeth good tidings, Mosiah 12:21. shall redeem his people, Mosiah 15:1. satisfied the demands of justice, Mosiah 15:9. redemption … through the … death of Christ, Mosiah 18:2 (3 Ne. 9:17). Christ … redeem his people from their sins, Alma 5:27. sufferings and death of Christ atone for their sins, Alma 22:14. God himself atoneth for the sins of the world, to bring about the plan of mercy, Alma 42:15. by me redemption cometh, 3 Ne. 9:17. taking upon me the sins of the world, 3 Ne. 11:11. I have come to fulfil the law, 3 Ne. 15:5. In me shall all mankind have life, Ether 3:14.",
